<h1>Add a Beer</h1>

<p>Finds the oldest review in your Untappd RSS feed that isn't on the site yet, and adds it. Runs automatically at 12pm, 4pm, 6pm, 9pm and 11pm UTC.</p>

<form class="form" method="get" action="/.netlify/functions/import-next-review-now">
	<button type="submit" class="button">Import next review from RSS</button>
</form>

<p><a href="/.netlify/functions/resolve-instagram-links-now">Resolve Instagram links</a> for beers with a pending Buffer post.</p>

<h2>Add manually</h2>

<form class="form" method="get" action="/.netlify/functions/parse-review-url">
	<div class="field">
		<label for="token">Token</label>
		<input type="text" name="token" id="token">
	</div>
	<div class="field">
		<label for="url">URL</label>
		<input type="text" name="url" id="URL">
	</div>
	<button type="submit" class="button">Add</button>
</form>

<h2>Retry a Buffer post</h2>

<p>Re-schedules the Buffer post for a beer that's already on the site (e.g. if the original post failed).</p>

<form class="form" method="get" action="/.netlify/functions/retry-buffer-post">
	<div class="field">
		<label for="retry-token">Token</label>
		<input type="text" name="token" id="retry-token">
	</div>
	<div class="field">
		<label for="permalink">Permalink</label>
		<input type="text" name="permalink" id="permalink" placeholder="beer/passing-cloud-floc/">
	</div>
	<button type="submit" class="button">Retry</button>
</form>

<h2>Queue an existing Buffer post</h2>

<p>Finds a beer's post directly in Buffer (matching by caption text) and adds it to the pending-instagram-links queue, for a beer whose post was scheduled but never got queued for linking.</p>

<form class="form" method="get" action="/.netlify/functions/queue-buffer-post">
	<div class="field">
		<label for="queue-token">Token</label>
		<input type="text" name="token" id="queue-token">
	</div>
	<div class="field">
		<label for="queue-permalink">Permalink</label>
		<input type="text" name="permalink" id="queue-permalink" placeholder="beer/passing-cloud-floc/">
	</div>
	<button type="submit" class="button">Queue</button>
</form>
